---
description: Database conventions — SQLite, repositories, migrations, SQL safety
globs: src/clible/db/**/*.py, src/clible/db/**/*.sql, src/clible/**/repositories/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Database rules

- SQLite only, no ORM
- Raw SQL in repository methods
- **Parameterized queries only** — never f-strings in SQL: `cursor.execute("... WHERE id = ?", (id,))`
- Foreign keys enforced: `PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON`
- Schema changes via numbered migration files in `src/clible/db/migrations/` only
- UUIDs for primary keys (generate in Python with `uuid.uuid4()`)
